From 2aacf84c61e0a37cb4937e3179bbef285423c0a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:03:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: About-to-Skills bridge scene and a larger, waveform
 hero name

Bridge (replaces the signal divider between About and Skills)
- pinned scene: the About's sheet carries a sentence; the sampler, cassette and
  record from the About's chapters fly in; the Skills' room opens from the
  sheet's centre as an iris; the devices dock into three rack slots labelled
  FRONTEND / APP + DATA / DELIVERY + INFRA (real MIXER_DATA text); cables run
  out of the bottom into the Skills controller
- pure, tested frame maths; one hook, writes custom properties and transforms
  on small nodes only; static composition for phones, reduced motion, no script
- removed section-signaldivider and its scroll timeline

Hero name
- one line instead of two (ceiling 96px -> 176px; 8.7vw), weight 800
- letters rise out of per-word masks on load, then swell on a phase-shifted
  wave so the name reads as the waveform behind it; reduced motion disables
- accessible name via aria-label; letters aria-hidden
